    "items": [
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "A Call to Repentance"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          1
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Come, let’s return to the Lord.",
          "For he has torn us,",
          "and he will heal us;",
          "he has wounded us,",
          "and he will bind up our wounds."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          2
        ],
        "lines": [
          "He will revive us after two days,",
          "and on the third day he will raise us up",
          "so we can live in his presence."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          3
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Let’s strive to know the Lord.",
          "His appearance is as sure as the dawn.",
          "He will come to us like the rain,",
          "like the spring showers that water the land."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "heading1",
        "verse_numbers": [],
        "lines": [
          "The Lord’s First Lament"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          4
        ],
        "lines": [
          "What am I going to do with you, Ephraim?",
          "What am I going to do with you, Judah?",
          "Your love is like the morning mist",
          "and like the early dew that vanishes."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          5
        ],
        "lines": [
          "This is why I have used the prophets",
          "to cut them down; ,",
          "I have killed them with the words from my mouth.",
          "My judgment strikes like lightning."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          6
        ],
        "lines": [
          "For I desire faithful love and not sacrifice,",
          "the knowledge of God rather than burnt offerings."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          7
        ],
        "lines": [
          "But they, like Adam, have violated the covenant;",
          "there they have betrayed me."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          8
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Gilead is a city of evildoers,",
          "tracked with bloody footprints."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          9
        ],
        "lines": [
          "Like raiders who wait in ambush for someone,",
          "a band of priests murders on the road to Shechem.",
          "They commit atrocities."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          10
        ],
        "lines": [
          "I have seen something horrible in the house of Israel:",
          "Ephraim’s promiscuity is there; Israel is defiled."
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      },
      {
        "type": "verse",
        "verse_numbers": [
          11
        ],
        "lines": [
          "A harvest is also appointed for you, Judah.",
          "When I restore the fortunes of my people,"
        ],
        "rlw_lines": []
      }
    ]
  },
